{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amp is a rhythm space shooter, where every action releases a satisfying rhythmic reaction to the music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse in the abstract art world where sound is the heart of every experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498650/extras/36bb804523f072b2d4124545e19e78a5.poster.avif?t=1759894747\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498650/extras/36bb804523f072b2d4124545e19e78a5.webm?t=1759894747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498650/extras/36bb804523f072b2d4124545e19e78a5.mp4?t=1759894747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>IMMERSE IN THE RHYTHMIC WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you are picking a fight with the boss named Decibel, firing at an amplifier, or riding the [musical] sea waves of the levels, you will find an audio inspiration around every corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See how many musical references you can find as you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498650/extras/de17f62ed44b852a480cbf27b6f0b7f8.poster.avif?t=1759894747\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498650/extras/de17f62ed44b852a480cbf27b6f0b7f8.webm?t=1759894747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498650/extras/de17f62ed44b852a480cbf27b6f0b7f8.mp4?t=1759894747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RHYTHM GAMER? OR CHILL? HOW ABOUT BOTH!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you aiming for the top of the leaderboards by getting the highest rhythm perfection multiplier, are you planning to chill, or are you somewhere in between? There's a mode for every mood and player skill level!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you worked out the best combination to chain combo and get the best score in every situation?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498650/extras/bdbad5ef6e74cbd078d06571332eeaec.poster.avif?t=1759894747\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498650/extras/bdbad5ef6e74cbd078d06571332eeaec.webm?t=1759894747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498650/extras/bdbad5ef6e74cbd078d06571332eeaec.mp4?t=1759894747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WEAPON OF CHOICE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Like to take control of every target you aim, or want to aim at one to automatically chain at other things? Freely swap between levels as you soar through. Some weapons work better than others depending on the situation, so strategize your way through!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you try to play a whole level with just one weapon?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2498650?t=1759894747","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498650/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759894747","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498650/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759894747","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_ass